      "title_size": "sm",
      "title_align": "left",
      "section": "Tracks on a locus",
      "order": 3,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "Both tiles open on the IGF2 and KCNQ1 imprinted domain: the navigator shows the CTCF peaks there, the track below the ChIP-seq depth per track over the hg38 genes. Type a locus or a gene symbol in the navigator header, or brush its axis, and both tiles move together; scroll to zoom and drag to pan inside either. Both tiles read table collections here; with source file the same tile range-reads the VCF, BAM, bigWig or GFF3 a pipeline such as sarek, chipseq or rnaseq publishes.\n",
      "wf_tag": "python/advanced_viz_demo"
    },
